    <briefdescription>
<para>Test plugin whose capabilities can be mutated between calls. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>loadCapabilities_ is what the plugin reports at initialization (frozen by <ref refid="class_plugin_manager" kindref="compound">PluginManager</ref>). runtimeCapabilities_ is what the plugin reports after load; when different from loadCapabilities_, it simulates a post-activation capability escalation attempt. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
